If you want to be safe then use Crawl's tiles rather than Nethack's;
they are definitely open for general use, and are generally much more
attractive anyway. That being said, the RLTiles Nethack tiles are
(mostly) not Nethack's default tiles, so you should be perfectly safe
using them as well under the RLTiles license, perhaps avoiding things
like the traps and drawbridges that apparently were taken straight
from default tiles.


